          "end": 6.42,
          "en": "we added the can activate guard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.42,
          "end": 8.46,
          "en": "and it was working fine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.46,
          "end": 11.88,
          "en": "but it was working for our whole servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.88,
          "end": 13.23,
          "en": "path here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.23,
          "end": 15.57,
          "en": "Now we could grab it from here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.57,
          "end": 17.61,
          "en": "and add it to our child's to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.61,
          "end": 19.38,
          "en": "that only the child's are protected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.38,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "the children,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 22.56,
          "en": "and not our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.56,
          "end": 23.493,
          "en": "root path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 26.28,
          "en": "But that is not the easiest way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 29.13,
          "en": "because if we add more child items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.13,
          "end": 30.33,
          "en": "we have to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 30.33,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "add can activate to each of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 34.56,
          "en": "There is another",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 34.56,
          "end": 35.82,
          "en": "guard we can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 35.82,
          "end": 38.7,
          "en": "It's pretty similar to can activate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 38.7,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "It's called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 40.92,
          "en": "can activate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 40.92,
          "end": 41.753,
          "en": "child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 41.753,
          "end": 43.8,
          "en": "So let's implement this interface two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 43.8,
          "end": 46.86,
          "en": "You need to import it from at angler router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 46.86,
          "end": 49.29,
          "en": "And this interface requires you to provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 49.29,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "a can activate child method in this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "which basically takes the same form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "as the can activate method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 57.863,
          "en": "So,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 57.863,
          "end": 58.696,
          "en": "it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 58.696,
          "end": 59.94,
          "en": "has",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 59.94,
          "end": 61.77,
          "en": "the route and state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 64.83,
          "en": "and it returns an observable promise or bullying.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 64.83,
          "end": 67.713,
          "en": "So this is the form of can activate child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 68.64,
          "end": 70.65,
          "en": "Well, and since this is exactly the same form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 70.65,
          "end": 72.93,
          "en": "and we want to run the same logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 72.93,
          "end": 74.4,
          "en": "we can simply call,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 74.4,
          "end": 75.233,
          "en": "or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 75.233,
          "end": 76.26,
          "en": "excuse me, return.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 76.26,
          "end": 77.093,
          "en": "This",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 77.093,
          "end": 78.24,
          "en": "can activate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 78.24,
          "end": 80.76,
          "en": "So the other method we already included",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 80.76,
          "end": 82.44,
          "en": "and here we simply pass our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 82.44,
          "end": 84.06,
          "en": "route and state as arguments,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 87.57,
          "en": "since can activate expects these two arguments.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 87.57,
          "end": 90.6,
          "en": "What is the advantage of adding this then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 90.6,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "Well, since we added the can activate child interface,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 98.58,
          "en": "we can now use a different hook here in our routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 98.58,
          "end": 101.55,
          "en": "Instead of only using can activate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 101.55,
          "end": 103.32,
          "en": "we can use a different one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 106.08,
          "en": "And I will split this over multiple lines to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 106.08,
          "end": 108.24000000000001,
          "en": "make it really clear on what's happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 108.24000000000001,
          "end": 110.46000000000001,
          "en": "I will comment out can activate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 110.46000000000001,
          "end": 111.81,
          "en": "and instead add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 111.81,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 113.82,
          "en": "activate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 113.82,
          "end": 114.75,
          "en": "child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 114.75,
          "end": 117,
          "en": "This now also takes an array of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 117,
          "end": 119.00999999999999,
          "en": "services which act as guards,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 119.00999999999999,
          "end": 121.26,
          "en": "which implement the right interfaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 124.02,
          "en": "And here we can still add the off-guard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 124.02,
          "end": 126.93,
          "en": "because the off-guard now is able to do both.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 126.93,
          "end": 128.67,
          "en": "Protect a single route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 128.67,
          "end": 130.95,
          "en": "since we have can activate implemented,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 130.95,
          "end": 132.78,
          "en": "or all child routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 132.78,
          "end": 136.65,
          "en": "since we have can activate child implemented too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 136.65,
          "end": 139.92000000000002,
          "en": "So if this in place, we should now be able to go to servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 139.92000000000002,
          "end": 141.18,
          "en": "This works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 141.18,
          "end": 143.91,
          "en": "But if we try to load a single server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 143.91,
          "end": 146.16,
          "en": "now we get redirected back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 146.16,
          "end": 149.01,
          "en": "because now only the child routes are protected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 149.01,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "Something I can also prove",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 153.96,
          "en": "by trying to go to slash one edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 153.96,
          "end": 156.42000000000002,
          "en": "This also navigates us back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 156.42000000000002,
          "end": 159.27,
          "en": "So now this is defined grain control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 159.27,
          "end": 160.86,
          "en": "you can implement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 160.86,
          "end": 164.61,
          "en": "to protect a whole route and all its child routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 164.61,
          "end": 166.47,
          "en": "or just the child routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 166.47,
          "end": 169.683,
          "en": "depending on which behavior you need in your app.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
